    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for components that need periodic updates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a simple heartbeat mechanism with fixed period. Derived classes must implement <ref refid="classeva_1_1_heartbeat_1a3e145aa3d580e403397d8e59d36a84ec" kindref="member">onHeartbeat()</ref> which will be called at regular intervals.</para>
<para>The period is set at construction and cannot be changed (immutable). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
